OL,3,GNEWSADUP leader says Sinn Fein presence
OL,4,Aat Orange Order protest 'unlawful' as
OL,5,Amarch delayed for hours
OL,6,
OL,7,FA controversial parade organised by
OL,8,FNorthern Ireland's Orange Order has
OL,9,Fbeen delayed as hundreds of protesters
OL,10,Fblock its route in Portadown
OL,12,FNorthern Ireland First Minister
OL,13,FMichelle O'Neill, who is among the
OL,14,Fprotesters on Garvaghy Road, says the
OL,15,Fdecision to allow the march to go ahead
OL,16,Ffor the first time in 30 years "brings
OL,17,Finto question how the peace process
OL,18,Fworks"
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,412,410,260,120,0,100
