OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSADUP leader says Sinn Fein presence
OL,4,Aat Orange Order protest 'unlawful' as
OL,5,Amarch delayed for hours
OL,6,
OL,7,FDUP leader Gavin Robinson has
OL,8,Fcriticised her party's participation in
OL,9,Fthe protest, telling a news conference
OL,10,Fthat O'Neill and other Sinn Fein
OL,11,Fpoliticians are "lawmakers acting as
OL,12,Flawbreakers"
OL,14,FPolice have called on protesters on
OL,15,FGarvaghy Road to disperse. A mile away,
OL,16,FOrangemen - who were due to march there
OL,17,Ffor the first time in 30 years - are
OL,18,Fwaiting for the road to clear - what
OL,19,Fcould happen now?
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
